text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_0816B347 {
    "MR. BRINEY: Ahoy!\nWe’ve hit land in DEWFORD.\pI suppose you’re off to deliver that\nLETTER to, who was it now, STEVEN!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_0816B4B5 {
    "MR. BRINEY: Ahoy!\nWe’ve hit land in DEWFORD!\pYou just go on and tell me whenever\nyou want to set sail again!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_0816DA13 {
    "That seaside cottage is where\nMR. BRINEY lives.\pHe was once a mighty sailor who never\nfeared the sea, however stormy."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_0816DD91 {
    "This FLOWER SHOP started selling\nsaplings recently.\pIt made me so happy, I went overboard\nshopping. I don’t need this WHITE HERB\lanymore. Would you take it, please?"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_0816DE36 {
    "This FLOWER SHOP started selling\nsaplings recently.\pIt made me so happy, I went overboard\nshopping. Where should I put them?"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B85EB {
    "¿Conoces al famoso…\pSUPERPESCADOR?\p{COLOR 0x04}{PLAYER}: Pues no la verdad…\p{COLOR 0x01}Pues soy yo"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8637 {
    "Con lo que me costó capturar todos \nestos pokemon… \p¡Ya buscaré más!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8680 {
    "Q incultura\pNo conocer al superpescador\nno conocerme a mí!\l"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8C28 {
    "Jaja…\n¡Que tupi!\lHay que ser muy idiota para navegar\lsobre un cachorro de Lapras…\ljaja…\p{COLOR 0x06}Huiii\p{COLOR 0x01}Glug, glug…\n"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8C99 {
    "Glub... Glub..."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8CA9 {
    "Sigo creyendo q es ridículo nadar\nasí si puedes alquilar una lancha."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8CEE {
    "Nadar es un gran ejercicio\p…yo estoy tan atletico!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8D23 {
    "Estoy perdiendo mi forma…"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8D45 {
    "Para tener tan buena forma como yo\nnada…\l…o apuntate a un gimnasio\l…pero…\p¡Muévete!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8D99 {
    "Cuando entro en el agua me siento \ntan super ligera como un Hoppip."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8DDD {
    "¡Oh! ¿Porque…"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8DED {
    "Cuando estoy en el agua es como\nsi volase entre las nubes…\pParece ser un problema de coordinación."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8E66 {
    "Es increible lo relajantes que son    \nestas islas."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8EA0 {
    "¡Perdí porque no te miraba !"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081B8EBD {
    "¿Podrìa estar aún más relajado?\p{COLOR 0x04}Vas a…\p{COLOR 0x01}glug…"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081BD02B {
    "My POKéMON rule!\nCheck them out!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081BD04C {
    "Ouch! A scrape!\nI have to put on a bandage!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081BD078 {
    "Bandages are signs of toughness!\nI’ve got another one!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081BD1C0 {
    "We learn all sorts of things at the\nTRAINER’S SCHOOL.\pI want to test things out for real!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081BD21A {
    "I slacked off in school...\nThat’s why I lost."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081BD248 {
    "I’ll have to redo some courses at the\nTRAINER’S SCHOOL.\lIf I don’t, ROXANNE will be steamed."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081BD2A5 {
    "I’ve been studying seriously at the\nTRAINER’S SCHOOL.\lI won’t lose like I did last time."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081BD2FE {
    "Hunh?\nI studied diligently."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081BD31A {
    "I’ll have to redo some courses at the\nTRAINER’S SCHOOL.\lIf I don’t, ROXANNE will be steamed."
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081BFFF0 {
    "You seem to have a big collection\nof GYM BADGES.\pLet me see if you’re actually worthy of\nthose BADGES!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081C0057 {
    "Oh, you’re worthy, all right!"
}

text Naranja_Islas_G00_M19_Text_081C0075 {
    "You did your BADGES proud in that\nmatch!"
}
